And when asked why, you just get a shrug back.

00:06:41.509 --> 00:06:44.129
I also took the definition from Wikipedia.

00:06:44.870 --> 00:06:50.850
A heuristic is "a pragmatic method
that is not fully optimized, perfected,

00:06:51.069 --> 00:06:56.230
or rationalized, but is nevertheless
'good enough' as an approximation.

00:06:56.569 --> 00:07:03.709
This is achieved by trading optimality,
completeness, accuracy, or precision for speed."

00:07:04.350 --> 00:07:09.389
I have big question mark on the
